# Moods of AI lines through the bridge: run with an AI server (GOTHIC_AI_URL) whose scenario makes Xardas
# answer (m1 with given lines on off: "[friendly] ... [angry] ..."). The camera at his face, nothing else.
cheat god
view clean 30
watch nearest
place 150 0
cam face 45 15 1
rec ai
wait 16000
stop
